{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Annota Line </i>is an interactive fiction about a train heist against the gods. Play as Serafin, an upstart gang leader in a decaying cyberpunk city, as she leads an unlikely team against the most powerful entities in every plane of existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this story that unfolds over three acts, you will:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a gang of troubled, charming characters</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate rich environments with classic point-and-click controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a post-epidemic city ravaged by warring gangs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Untangle a web of drug-trafficking gods and profiteering politicians</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3526440?t=1746896265","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3526440?t=1746896265","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526440/5ece56016d36d8eff85253ff7f3460f8874731a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746896265","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526440/5ece56016d36d8eff85253ff7f3460f8874731a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746896265","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Depictions of violence and drug abuse."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Annota Line </i>is an interactive fiction about a train heist against the gods. Play as Serafin, an upstart gang leader in a decaying cyberpunk city, as she leads an unlikely team against the most powerful entities in every plane of existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this story that unfolds over three ac